        {
          "text": "Munyo Apolo oridho paro ma kidho Akaya, jom'oyeyo ma Efeso jomedo go meni, to jondiko ri jom'oyeyo ma yukorago ni jowojoli go kenyo. Munyo go otundo koro, obedo gi kony madwoŋ swa ri jono ma gi nema pa Were oyido jolokere jom'oyeyo. ",
